      {/* Founders Section */}
      <section className={styles.foundersSection}>
        <div className={styles.founderRow}>
          <div className={styles.founderImageContainer}>
            <Image 
              src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6397a990f9c238169485ce1d/63af029ef706a13cd2eb31f2_Maria%20barrientos%20Salon%20Mar%C3%ADa%20Bonita%20Beauty.jpeg" 
              alt="María Barrientos" 
              fill 
              className={styles.founderImg} 
            />
          </div>
          <div className={styles.founderTextContainer}>
            <h3 className={styles.founderNameTitle}>maría barrientos</h3>
            <p className={styles.founderBio}>In 2003, a great need led me to change the course of my life. This project presented itself as a great opportunity. At that moment, it seemed impossible to achieve this dream. However, with all my faith and determination, it was accomplished. To this day, it remains a reality and the most beautiful project of my life. In 2015, my daughter Melissa joined this project because she also found it interesting, which is very satisfying to me! Working together seemed truly positive, as it became a family project and the combination of our talents has strengthened us successfully in this field. Throughout this wonderful journey, the most beautiful thing I have learned is that every client deserves to be treated as the most valuable thing in life, and the connection we can achieve with people is truly a life purpose. The name María Bonita emerged because, for me, it is a privilege to bear that name, as many other women who I am sure feel proud to carry it do. There is a song (MARÍA BONITA) by the author Agustín Lara, inspired by a woman named María Félix, and I felt that it is a source of pride for people around me to know how beautiful that name is! To those who believe, everything is possible!</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div className={styles.founderRow}>
          <div className={styles.founderImageContainer}>
            <Image 
              src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6397a990f9c238169485ce1d/63aee23d8792abbc92a39642_Brenda%20Mar%C3%ADa%20Bonita%20Beauty%20Salon.jpeg" 
              alt="Melissa Barrientos" 
              fill 
              className={styles.founderImg} 
            />
          </div>
          <div className={styles.founderTextContainer}>
            <h3 className={styles.founderNameTitle}>MELISSA barrientos</h3>
            <p className={styles.founderBio}>In 2015, I started this project initially because I was inspired by my mother&apos;s great talent. I grew up in the beauty industry and love everything about my career as a cosmetologist. My greatest inspiration is seeing my clients happy and being able to contribute to making them feel unique and beautiful. It is a pleasure to serve our people with love and respect.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

